OpenVitals — data attribution notice

The bundled sleep-staging model (src/openvitals/assets/stager_hr_4class.onnx) was trained on,
and the benchmark results in this repository were computed from, the two datasets below.

  Contains information from the BIDSleep Apple Watch Dataset
  (https://physionet.org/content/bidsleep-dataset/1.0.1/), which is made available under the
  ODC Attribution License (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/).

  Contains information from "Motion and heart rate from a wrist-worn wearable and labeled sleep
  from polysomnography" (https://physionet.org/content/sleep-accel/1.0.0/), which is made available
  under the ODC Attribution License (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/).

No raw data from either dataset is included in this package or repository.

